      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">二、非选择题：</section><br>9. 学生小组为了探究超重和失重现象，将弹簧测力计挂在电梯内，测力计下端挂一物体。已知当地重力加速度大小为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/375cecf6d215dbc3ac85.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/80fcf4a6e8b676fe7758.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（1）电梯静止时测力计示数如图所示，读数为_____N（结果保留1位小数）；<br>（2）电梯上行时，一段时间内测力计的示数为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/1dbaf3837929959af11a.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，则此段时间内物体处于_____（填“超重”或“失重”）状态，电梯加速度大小为_____<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/5d22a231fd527adc1e0e.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> （结果保留1位小数）。",
