      "question_id": "gaokao_diag_physics_02_q19",
      "sequence": 19,
      "type": "constructed_response",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">（一）必考题：共129分。</section><br>9. 某同学用伏安法测绘一额定电压为6V、额定功率为3W的小灯泡的伏安特性曲线，实验所用电压表内阻约为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/e1a7344b6a193672dae8.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">电流表内阻约为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/44cb687184661013b62f.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">．实验中有图（a）和（b）两个电路图供选择。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/d2274756963660dcf66d.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（1）实验中得到的电流I和电压U的关系曲线如图（c）所示，该同学选择的电路图是图________（填“a”或“b”）<br>（2）若选择另一个电路图进行实验，在答题卡所给图上用实线画出实验中应得到<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/e3095deb429743800a57.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">关系曲线的示意图______。",
